---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="조직 구성" description="사회적협동조합 가치로운의 조직 구성">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>조직 구성</h1>
      <p>민주적이고 투명한 협동조합 운영</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section org-intro">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="intro-content">
        <h2>협동조합 운영 체계</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          사회적협동조합 가치로운은 <strong>협동조합기본법</strong>에 따라<br />
          민주적 의사결정과 투명한 운영을 실천하는 사회적 경제 조직입니다.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="org-principles">
        <div class="principle-card">
          <div class="principle-icon">🗳️</div>
          <h4>민주적 운영</h4>
          <p>1인 1표의 원칙으로 조합원 모두가 평등하게 의사결정에 참여합니다.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="principle-card">
          <div class="principle-icon">🤝</div>
          <h4>참여와 협력</h4>
          <p>조합원, 이용자, 직원이 함께 만들어가는 공동체입니다.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="principle-card">
          <div class="principle-icon">💎</div>
          <h4>투명한 경영</h4>
          <p>정기총회와 이사회를 통해 모든 정보를 공개하고 공유합니다.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section org-structure">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">조직도</h2>
      
      <div class="org-chart">
        <div class="org-level level-1">
          <div class="org-box main">
            <h3>총회</h3>
            <p>최고 의사결정기구</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="org-level level-2">
          <div class="org-box">
            <h3>이사회</h3>
            <p>이사장, 이사</p>
          </div>
          <div class="org-box">
            <h3>감사</h3>
            <p>업무 및 회계 감사</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="org-level level-3">
          <div class="org-box wide">
            <h3>사무국</h3>
            <p>이사장 / 사무국장</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="org-level level-4">
          <div class="org-box">
            <h4>재가방문요양팀</h4>
            <p>재가요양 서비스 제공</p>
          </div>
          <div class="org-box">
            <h4>장애인활동지원팀</h4>
            <p>활동지원 서비스 제공</p>
          </div>
          <div class="org-box">
            <h4>아동청소년지원팀</h4>
            <p>교육·문화 프로그램 운영</p>
          </div>
          <div class="org-box">
            <h4>행정지원팀</h4>
            <p>총무, 회계, 인사</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section governance">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">운영 기구</h2>
      
      <div class="governance-grid">
        <div class="governance-card">
          <h3>📋 총회</h3>
          <div class="card-content">
            <p class="description">협동조합의 최고 의사결정기구</p>
            <ul>
              <li>정기총회: 매년 1회 (3월)</li>
              <li>임시총회: 필요시 수시 개최</li>
              <li>주요 안건: 사업계획, 예산·결산, 정관 변경 등</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="governance-card">
          <h3>👔 이사회</h3>
          <div class="card-content">
            <p class="description">조합의 업무집행 의사결정기구</p>
            <ul>
              <li>구성: 이사장 1인, 이사 5인 이상</li>
              <li>임기: 4년 (연임 가능)</li>
              <li>회의: 정기 이사회 및 임시 이사회</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="governance-card">
          <h3>🔍 감사</h3>
          <div class="card-content">
            <p class="description">업무 및 회계 감사기구</p>
            <ul>
              <li>구성: 감사 2인</li>
              <li>임기: 4년 (연임 가능)</li>
              <li>역할: 업무·회계 감사, 총회 보고</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section executives">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">임원 현황</h2>
      
      <div class="executives-info">
        <div class="executive-card highlight">
          <div class="executive-position">이사장</div>
          <div class="executive-name">구자애</div>
          <div class="executive-role">조합 대표 및 총괄</div>
        </div>

        <div class="executive-grid">
          <div class="executive-card">
            <div class="executive-position">이사</div>
            <div class="executive-desc">사업 운영 및 의사결정 참여</div>
          </div>

          <div class="executive-card">
            <div class="executive-position">감사</div>
            <div class="executive-desc">업무 및 회계 감사</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section membership">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">조합원 구성</h2>
      
      <div class="membership-grid">
        <div class="member-type">
          <div class="member-icon">👥</div>
          <h4>생산자 조합원</h4>
          <p>활동지원사, 요양보호사 등 서비스를 제공하는 조합원</p>
        </div>

        <div class="member-type">
          <div class="member-icon">🏠</div>
          <h4>이용자 조합원</h4>
          <p>돌봄 서비스를 이용하는 당사자 및 가족</p>
        </div>

        <div class="member-type">
          <div class="member-icon">🤝</div>
          <h4>후원자 조합원</h4>
          <p>조합의 목적에 동의하고 후원하는 개인 및 단체</p>
        </div>

        <div class="member-type">
          <div class="member-icon">💼</div>
          <h4>직원 조합원</h4>
          <p>사무국 및 각 팀에서 근무하는 직원</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-content">
        <h2>가치로운 조합원이 되어주세요</h2>
        <p>함께 만들어가는 가치있는 세상에 동참하실 분을 기다립니다</p>
        <div class="cta-buttons">
          <a href="tel:010-6549-8765" class="btn btn-primary">📞 010-6549-8765</a>
          <a href="mailto:nzin4x@gmail.com" class="btn btn-secondary">✉️ 이메일 문의</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary-500) 0%, var(--color-primary-700) 100%);
    color: white;
    padding: var(--spacing-3xl) 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
    color: white;
  }

  .page-hero p {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    opacity: 0.95;
  }

  .org-intro {
    padding: var(--spacing-4xl) 0;
    background: var(--color-bg-light);
  }

  .intro-content {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-3xl);
  }

  .intro-content h2 {
    color: var(--color-primary-600);
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-gray-700);
  }

  .org-principles {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--spacing-2xl);
  }

  .principle-card {
    background: white;
    padding: var(--spacing-2xl);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .principle-icon {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .principle-card h4 {
    color: var(--color-primary-600);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .principle-card p {
    color: var(--color-gray-700);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .org-structure {
    padding: var(--spacing-4xl) 0;
  }

  .section-title {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-600);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-3xl);
  }

  .org-chart {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .org-level {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2xl);
    position: relative;
  }

  .org-level::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -1rem;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 2px;
    height: var(--spacing-lg);
    background: var(--color-primary-300);
  }

  .org-level:last-child::after {
    display: none;
  }

  .org-box {
    background: white;
    padding: var(--spacing-xl);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    text-align: center;
    min-width: 180px;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-primary-200);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .org-box:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
    border-color: var(--color-primary-500);
  }

  .org-box.main {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary-500), var(--color-primary-600));
    color: white;
    border-color: var(--color-primary-700);
  }

  .org-box.main h3 {
    color: white;
  }

  .org-box.main p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
  }

  .org-box.wide {
    min-width: 300px;
  }

  .org-box h3, .org-box h4 {
    color: var(--color-primary-600);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .org-box p {
    color: var(--color-gray-600);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .governance {
    background: var(--color-bg-light);
    padding: var(--spacing-4xl) 0;
  }

  .governance-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--spacing-2xl);
  }

  .governance-card {
    background: white;
    padding: var(--spacing-2xl);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .governance-card h3 {
    color: var(--color-primary-600);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .description {
    color: var(--color-gray-700);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
  }

  .governance-card ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .governance-card li {
    padding: var(--spacing-sm) 0;
    padding-left: var(--spacing-lg);
    position: relative;
    color: var(--color-gray-700);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .governance-card li::before {
    content: "•";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-secondary-500);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .executives {
    padding: var(--spacing-4xl) 0;
  }

  .executives-info {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .executive-card {
    background: white;
    padding: var(--spacing-2xl);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
  }

  .executive-card.highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary-50), var(--color-accent-50));
    border: 2px solid var(--color-primary-300);
  }

  .executive-position {
    color: var(--color-primary-600);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .executive-name {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-gray-900);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .executive-role {
    color: var(--color-gray-600);
  }

  .executive-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--spacing-xl);
  }

  .executive-desc {
    color: var(--color-gray-600);
    margin-top: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .membership {
    background: var(--color-bg-light);
    padding: var(--spacing-4xl) 0;
  }

  .membership-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: var(--spacing-2xl);
  }

  .member-type {
    background: white;
    padding: var(--spacing-2xl);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .member-icon {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .member-type h4 {
    color: var(--color-primary-600);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
  }

  .member-type p {
    color: var(--color-gray-700);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .cta-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-secondary-500), var(--color-secondary-600));
    color: white;
    padding: var(--spacing-4xl) 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-content h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
    color: white;
  }

  .cta-content p {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    opacity: 0.95;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2xl);
  }

  .cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-2xl);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: white;
    color: var(--color-secondary-600);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-gray-100);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: white;
    border: 2px solid white;
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: white;
    color: var(--color-secondary-600);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .org-principles,
    .governance-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .membership-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .org-level {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-hero h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .org-principles,
    .governance-grid,
    .membership-grid,
    .executive-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .org-box {
      min-width: 150px;
    }

    .cta-buttons {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
